    "type": "game",
    "name": "Swing Solver",
    "steam_appid": 2669240,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Control the swing at will and aim for the goal! Fascinating trajectories drawn by a pendulum. &quot;Swing Solver&quot; is an easy yet profound physics action puzzle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669240/extras/996cd9ae8c2cd392e9dfa44c793fb5a0.poster.avif?t=1705676461\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669240/extras/996cd9ae8c2cd392e9dfa44c793fb5a0.webm?t=1705676461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669240/extras/996cd9ae8c2cd392e9dfa44c793fb5a0.mp4?t=1705676461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Easy yet profound action using swing. All you need to do is click and release. But the actions are infinite! </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Acceleration tiles, moving platforms, warp gates, and other obstacles that can drastically alter the ball's movement. If you can't control them, you'll hit a saw! </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Replays show the beautiful trajectory drawn by the pendulum after each success. The cooler the success, the more beautiful the trajectory! </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Simple graphics highlight the beautiful orbit of the pendulum. The world made of blue squares and round balls looks like a physics notebook. </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Calm sounds that match the graphics. </li></ul><br>The only actions used are firing and disconnecting the wire. It is a simple operation, but difficult to master. Where do you connect the wire? When to disconnect? Watch the movement of the pendulum and control the ball perfectly with a single wire!",
    "about_the_game": "Control the swing at will and aim for the goal! Fascinating trajectories drawn by a pendulum. &quot;Swing Solver&quot; is an easy yet profound physics action puzzle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669240/extras/996cd9ae8c2cd392e9dfa44c793fb5a0.poster.avif?t=1705676461\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669240/extras/996cd9ae8c2cd392e9dfa44c793fb5a0.webm?t=1705676461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669240/extras/996cd9ae8c2cd392e9dfa44c793fb5a0.mp4?t=1705676461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Easy yet profound action using swing. All you need to do is click and release. But the actions are infinite! </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Acceleration tiles, moving platforms, warp gates, and other obstacles that can drastically alter the ball's movement. If you can't control them, you'll hit a saw! </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Replays show the beautiful trajectory drawn by the pendulum after each success. The cooler the success, the more beautiful the trajectory! </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Simple graphics highlight the beautiful orbit of the pendulum. The world made of blue squares and round balls looks like a physics notebook. </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Calm sounds that match the graphics. </li></ul><br>The only actions used are firing and disconnecting the wire. It is a simple operation, but difficult to master. Where do you connect the wire? When to disconnect? Watch the movement of the pendulum and control the ball perfectly with a single wire!",
    "short_description": "Shoot, Swing, Jump! Control the ball perfectly with the wire!",
